# Lottery Engine v11.2 (Singularity) 🚀🌌

> A high-performance **Lottery Prediction & Analysis Engine** with 100+ CLI commands, 80+ prediction strategies, and a full-stack architecture spanning Terminal → Desktop → Mobile → API Gateway.

[![Python 3.11+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.11%2B-blue.svg)]()
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)]()
[![Strategies](https://img.shields.io/badge/strategies-80%2B-orange.svg)]()
[![Commands](https://img.shields.io/badge/CLI_commands-100%2B-purple.svg)]()

---

## 🏛️ Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│   Expo React Native App        PySide6 Desktop Client   │
│   (Mobile/Web Dashboard)       (Cockpit Analytics)      │
└────────────────┬───────────────────────┬────────────────┘
                 │ HTTP                  │ HTTP
         ┌───────┴───────────────────────┴───────┐
         │   Go API Gateway (Auth, Rate Limit,   │
         │   Caching, PQC Routing, Telemetry)    │
         └───────────────────┬───────────────────┘
                             │ HTTP (localhost)
         ┌───────────────────┴───────────────────┐
         │   Python FastAPI Sidecar (15+ REST    │
         │   endpoints, sacred manifold, expert) │
         └───────────────────┬───────────────────┘
                             │
         ┌───────────────────┴───────────────────┐
         │   Lottery Engine Core                  │
         │   ├── 80+ Prediction Strategies       │
         │   ├── 100+ CLI Commands               │
         │   ├── Adapters (BR, US, plug-n-play)  │
         │   ├── Modules (freq, deviation, etc.) │
         │   └── Wheels (covering designs, PyPI) │
         └───────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Clone & setup
git clone <repo-url> && cd lottery-engine
./lottery setup                    # Auto-creates .venv, installs deps

# 2. Fetch lottery data
./lottery fetch br/lotofacil       # Brazilian Lotofácil
./lottery fetch br/mega-sena       # Brazilian Mega-Sena

# 3. Analyze
./lottery analyze br/lotofacil     # Full statistical dashboard
./lottery scan br/lotofacil        # 6-layer diagnostic scan

# 4. Generate predictions
./lottery suggest br/lotofacil --strategy weighted --count 3
./lottery forecast br/lotofacil    # Multi-strategy consensus ticket
./lottery next br/lotofacil        # One-line: scan + forecast + verdict

# 5. Daily workflow
./lottery daily br/lotofacil       # Morning digest pipeline
./lottery session br/lotofacil     # Full pre-draw decision cycle
```

