## 🎯 Command Reference (100+)

### ⭐ Primary Golden Path
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `wizard` | Interactive guided analysis & prediction |
| `fetch` | Fetch & cache historical draw data |
| `suggest` | Generate tickets using any strategy |
| `analyze` | Statistical dashboard (14+ chart types) |
| `backtest` | Blind historical strategy testing |
| `forecast` | Multi-strategy weighted consensus ticket |
| `next` | One-line: scan → forecast → verdict |
| `daily` | Morning digest pipeline |
| `session` | Full 5-stage pre-draw decision cycle |

### 🔬 Analytics & Diagnostics
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `dashboard` | Rich terminal analytical cockpit |
| `scan` | 6-layer diagnostic scan (GO/NO-GO) |
| `signal` | Signal-to-noise rolling window analysis |
| `cluster` | Unsupervised draw clustering (K-Means/DBSCAN) |
| `stress-test` | Adversarial pattern hallucination test |
| `detect-patterns` | Esoteric cycle overlay (lunar/solar) |
| `leaderboard` | Comparative strategy ranking |
| `entropy-scan` | Information entropy analysis |
| `variance-report` | 5-dimension volatility regime |
| `compare-draws` | Jensen-Shannon regime-shift detector |
| `compare-strategies` | Side-by-side strategy comparison |
| `streak-report` | Hot/cold streak rankings |
| `pair-analysis` | Co-occurrence lift analysis |
| `number-heat` | Full-pool hit/miss heatmap grid |
| `markov-table` | Transition probability matrix |
| `gap-forecast` | Per-number gap prediction |
| `momentum-check` | RSI-style momentum indicators |
| `outlier-draws` | Statistical outlier identification |
| `synergy-map` | Strategy agreement mapping |

### 🎟️ Betting & Tactical
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `wheel` | Combinatorial covering designs |
| `genetic-wheel` | Evolutionary wheel optimizer |
| `multi-ticket` | Multi-ticket coverage optimizer |
| `suggest-swaps` | Best single-number swap suggestions |
| `ticket-grade` | Grade a ticket (A+ → F) |
| `coverage-check` | Pool coverage grid analysis |
| `prize-ev` | Expected value calculator |
| `hedge` | Combinatorial hedging portfolio |
| `risk` | Kelly Criterion bet sizing |
| `quick` | One-line cron: scan + forecast |
| `picks` | Consensus from ticket log frequency |
| `expert-suggest` | Multi-lottery portfolio simulation |

### 📓 Monitoring & Logs
| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `log` / `log-view` | Daily tracker (JSONL/CSV/MD) |
