## 🧪 Installation

### Prerequisites
- **Python 3.11+**
- **Go 1.23.0** (for Gateway, optional)
- **Node.js / Bun** (for TUI, optional)

### Install
```bash
# Core (stats only)
pip install -e .

# With ML strategies (scikit-learn, XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost)
pip install -e ".[ml]"

# With deep learning (PyTorch, LSTM-CRF)
pip install -e ".[deep]"

# Full installation (everything including Desktop & API)
pip install -e ".[all]"

# Development
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

---

## 🌐 API (FastAPI Sidecar)

```bash
./lottery serve                    # Launch at http://localhost:8000
```

### Endpoints
| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/games` | List all registered games |
| GET | `/games/{name}` | Game rules & parameters |
| GET | `/games/{name}/analysis` | Statistical analysis |
| GET | `/games/{name}/odds` | Prize tier probabilities |
| GET | `/strategies` | List all 80+ strategies |
| POST | `/games/{name}/suggest` | Generate tickets |
| POST | `/games/{name}/backtest` | Run backtest |
| POST | `/games/{name}/check` | Check ticket structure |
| POST | `/games/{name}/calibrate` | Calibrate strategies |
| POST | `/games/{name}/tune` | Hyperparameter tuning |
| POST | `/games/{name}/prune` | Strategy pruning |
| POST | `/games/{name}/sacred-manifold` | Sacred geometry analysis |
| POST | `/games/{name}/expert-suggest` | Portfolio simulation |
| GET | `/games/{name}/sum-distribution` | Sum probability PMF |
| GET | `/games/{name}/gap/{number}` | Per-number gap analysis |
| POST | `/games/{name}/wheel` | Wheel generation |
| GET | `/health` | Service health check |

Interactive docs at `http://localhost:8000/docs` (Swagger UI).

